easingly digital."},{"type":"p","text":"Future professionals may work with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital collections"},{"text":"Virtual exhibitions"},{"text":"Online art sales"},{"text":"Digital archives"},{"text":"Art-tech platforms"},{"text":"AI-assisted cataloguing"},{"text":"Image recognition"},{"text":"Digital provenance"},{"text":"Immersive exhibitions"},{"text":"AR/VR experiences"},{"text":"Audience analytics"},{"text":"Digital marketing"},{"text":"Global artist networks"}]},{"type":"p","text":"AI can assist with cataloguing, metadata generation, translation, research organisation and visitor engagement, but art-historical judgement, provenance verification, curatorial interpretation and ethical decision-making require human oversight."}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Government / Public Sector / Cultural Institutions"},{"type":"table","header":["Organisation / environment","Useful exposure"],"rows":[[{"text":"National Gallery of Modern Art (NGMA)"},{"text":"Museum/gallery operations, collections and exhibitions"}],[{"text":"Lalit Kala Akademi"},{"text":"Visual arts and cultural programmes"}],[{"text":"National Museum"},{"text":"Collections, documentation and museum operations"}],[{"text":"Ministry of Culture institutions"},{"text":"Cultural administration"}],[{"text":"State museums"},{"text":"Collections and visitor services"}],[{"text":"State Lalit Kala / cultural academies"},{"text":"Art exhibitions and artist programmes"}],[{"text":"Public universities"},{"text":"Art galleries, museums and cultural centres"}],[{"text":"Government cultural centres"},{"text":"Exhibitions and public programmes"}],[{"text":"PM Internship Scheme"},{"text":"General industry exposure where eligible"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"For institutional information, explore Ministry of Culture and Lalit Kala Akademi.","url":"https://www.indiaculture.gov.in/"},{"type":"p","text":"For the PM Internship route, current eligibility and participating organisations should be checked at PM Internship Scheme.","url":"https://pminternship.mca.gov.in/"},{"type":"h","text":"Private / Industry"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Commercial art galleries"},{"text":"Contemporary art galleries"},{"text":"Artist studios"},{"text":"Auction houses"},{"text":"Art fairs"},{"text":"Museum foundations"},{"text":"Cultural organisations"},{"text":"Art consultancies"},{"text":"Art logistics companies"},{"text":"Art publications"},{"text":"Art foundations"},{"text":"Exhibition-design companies"},{"text":"Cultural-event companies"},{"text":"Digital art platforms"},{"text":"Art-tech companies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Search beyond the exact title"},{"type":"p","text":"Search for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Gallery Intern"},{"text":"Gallery Assistant Intern"},{"text":"Art Gallery Intern"},{"text":"Curatorial Intern"},{"text":"Exhibition Intern"},{"text":"Museum Intern"},{"text":"Collections Intern"},{"text":"Art Administration Intern"},{"text":"Art Research Intern"},{"text":"Artist Relations Intern"},{"text":"Art Events Intern"},{"text":"Museum Education Intern"}]}]},{"heading":"Certifications in Demand","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Certification / learning area","Why it matters"],"rows":[[{"text":"Museum Studies"},{"text":"Collections and museum operations"}],[{"text":"Curatorial Studies"},{"text":"Exhibition and research pathway"}],[{"text":"Art History"},{"text":"Professional art knowledge"}],[{"text":"Arts Management"},{"text":"Gallery administration"}],[{"text":"Heritage Management"},{"text":"Cultural-sector opportunities"}],[{"text":"Collections Management"},{"text":"Museum/gallery documentation"}],[{"text":"Conservation Fundamentals"},{"text":"Artwork handling awareness"}],[{"text":"Exhibition Design"},{"text":"Exhibition development"}],[{"text":"Digital Archiving"},{"text":"Digital collections"}],[{"text":"Adobe Photoshop/InDesign"},{"text":"Catalogue and visual communication"}],[{"text":"Digital Marketing"},{"text":"Gallery promotion"}],[{"text":"Project Management"},{"text":"Exhibition/event coordination"}],[{"text":"AI for Cultural Heritage"},{"text":"Future digital-art workflows"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Use NPTEL and relevant university/museum programmes for structured learning.","url":"https://nptel.ac.in/"},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"For Gallery Assistant roles, practical exhibition experience, internships, artwork documentation and art knowledge often matter more than collecting certificates."},{"type":"note","label":"Certification costs should be","text":"check the official site before being entered into a live database."}]},{"heading":"Careers You Can Be Hired As","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Realistic entry-level titles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Gallery Assistant"},{"text":"Gallery Intern"},{"text":"Exhibition Assistant"},{"text":"Curatorial Assistant"},{"text":"Collections Assistant"},{"text":"Museum Assistant"},{"text":"Art Research Assistant"},{"text":"Gallery Operations Assistant"},{"text":"Art Administration Assistant"},{"text":"Artist Relations Assistant"},{"text":"Exhibition Coordinator — Junior"},{"text":"Museum Education Assistant"},{"text":"Art Events Assistant"},{"text":"Art Documentation Assistant"},{"text":"Digital Collections Assistant"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Role-to-skill map"},{"type":"table","header":["Role","Stack the posting asks for","Where the student proves it"],"rows":[[{"text":"Gallery Assistant"},{"text":"Art knowledge + visitor support"},{"text":"Gallery internship"}],[{"text":"Exhibition Assistant"},{"text":"Exhibition + logistics"},{"text":"Exhibition project"}],[{"text":"Curatorial Assistant"},{"text":"Research + art history"},{"text":"Curatorial portfolio"}],[{"text":"Collections Assistant"},{"text":"Documentation + cataloguing"},{"text":"Artwork catalogue"}],[{"text":"Museum Assistant"},{"text":"Visitor + collections support"